# The app keeping itself current (Updates.kt): a newer build in the local cloud's releases (release-seed: this APK as
# version 0.1.1), found by the core's app.update at the start; settings' version row says 更新到 0.1.1; tapped, it is
# downloaded, checked against its sha256 and handed to the system's installer, which asks the person to confirm.
#only android
#env MBUI_UPDATE_FEED=android
#before release-seed
timeout 60000
until 端到端测试
tap icon:settings
# settings' home in place, then scrolled to its version row (under the fold)
until 此设备
drag 195 700 0 -500 400
until 更新到 0.1.1
shot 1-settings
tap 更新到 0.1.1
# downloaded and checked (正在安装), then held until the host says it has handed the build to the system's installer
# (its update ends: the app at rest), and the run kept until the installer's page is in front (the app's process
# asked it: a run ended before would leave the page unopened, an app out of the foreground may not open one); the
# runner keeps its page and declines it, the app in front again
until 正在安装
rest
log do: android-installer
done 1-android-installer
